OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 4 MAY
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GViolinist and vocalist Alice
OL,12,     GZawadzki sits in for Soweto Kinch
OL,13,     Gthis week on 'Round Midnight.
OL,14,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,15,     GSayaka Shoji and Ettore Pagano
OL,16,     Gjoin the Santa Cecilia Orchestra
OL,17,     Gand conductor Thomas Guggeis in
OL,18,     GBrahms's Double Concerto and the
OL,19,     Gorchestra also plays music by
OL,20,     GLiszt and Strauss.
